  "summary_en": "Runs a learned neural network that acts as cellular automata rules on an input cell state. It evolves the state over a set number of iterations to build complex patterns and textures. It is designed to be paired with the Neural Cellular Automata Decode COP, which turns the cell state into a visible pattern.",
