  "key_parameters": [
    "Model / NCA Model File: selects a preset or ONNX model file; Reload Model forces a reload",
    "Initialize Cells: outputs a starting cell state without running the model",
    "Model Iterations: how many times the model is applied per cook; more converges further but takes longer",
    "Seed: controls the random update mask and can produce pattern variations",
    "Update Rate (0.1 to 0.9): fraction of cells updated each iteration",
    "Update Mask Type: Amplitude-Weighted gives smoother evolution; Probabilistic gives noisier evolution with stronger cell-based structure",
